message: "Please cite this project using the metadata below."
title: "Conflict-Induced Displacement and Settlement Abandonment Detection Using Geospatial Analysis — Borno State, Nigeria (2015–2023)"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Abdazeez"
    given-names: "Abdullah Ayomide"
date-released: "2026-07-30"
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >
  An uncertainty-aware geospatial analysis of settlement contraction and potential
  conflict-induced abandonment across Borno State, Nigeria. The project integrates
  WorldPop population estimates, Landsat imagery, NDVI, NDBI, built-up indicators,
  statistical screening and structured manual evidence adjudication.
keywords:
  - geospatial analysis
  - remote sensing
  - settlement abandonment
  - conflict displacement
  - humanitarian GIS
  - Borno State
  - Nigeria
  - Landsat
  - WorldPop
